n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nexly - Universal Workspace</title>\n\n    <!-- Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: { sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'] },\n                    colors: {\n                        background: '#050507',\n                        surface: '#111113',\n                        surfaceElevated: '#17171A',\n                        borderSubtle: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)',\n                        brand: {\n                            500: '#6366f1',\n                            glow: '#818cf8'\n                        }\n                    },\n                    backgroundImage: {\n                        'gradient-radial': 'radial-gradient(var(--tw-gradient-stops))',\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n\n    <!-- Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <style>\n        /* Base styles & Scrollbar */\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; height: 6px; }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #27272a; border-radius: 4px; }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #3f3f46; }\n\n        /* Framed Grid Layout Utilities */\n        .frame-container {\n            position: relative;\n            background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 0px, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 10px);\n        }\n        .frame-border {\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n        }\n        .corner-bracket {\n            position: absolute;\n            width: 12px;\n            height: 12px;\n            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n            z-index: 10;\n        }\n        .corner-tl { top: -1px; left: -1px; border-top-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; }\n        .corner-tr { top: -1px; right: -1px; border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; }\n        .corner-bl { bottom: -1px; left: -1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; }\n        .corner-br { bottom: -1px; right: -1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; }\n\n        /* Masked Reveal Utilities */\n        .reveal-wrapper {\n            overflow: hidden;\n            display: inline-block;\n            vertical-align: top;\n        }\n        .reveal-text {\n            display: inline-block;\n            transform: translateY(110%);\n        }\n\n        /* Border Gradient Utilities */\n        .border-gradient-base {\n            position: relative;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n        }\n        .border-gradient-base::before {\n            content: \"\";\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: -1px;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n            padding: 1px;\n            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.0) 100%);\n            -webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);\n            -webkit-mask-composite: xor;\n            mask-composite: exclude;\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        /* App Mockup specific */\n        .glass-panel {\n            background: rgba(17, 17, 19, 0.7);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n        }\n        .noise-bg {\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: 0;\n            background-image: url(\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 200 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noiseFilter'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.65' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noiseFilter)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E\");\n            opacity: 0.015;\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"antialiased bg-[#050507] text-zinc-300 selection:bg-indigo-500/30 overflow-x-hidden font-sans\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"laserCanvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-0\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Global Noise Overlay -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 noise-bg z-[1]\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 min-h-screen flex flex-col\">\n\n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-6 max-w-[1400px] mx-auto z-50\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 t